{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923280/extras/d8e493dbc2ceedc1a7c46199bbb71eb2.avif?t=1734094171\" width=616 height=222 /></span><br>CARnage is a classic top-down arcade combat racing game set in a dystopian future.<br><br>Grow your garage and earn money through racing and upgrade your rides to explore the different worlds of CARnage.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923280/extras/cdea9b620fff1d55711a578714aacc69.avif?t=1734094171\" width=616 height=80 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Levels</h2>Experience 46 levels spanning over 3 distinct worlds.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cars</h2>Unlock new cars through out your adventures and find your preferred style to survive the Apocalypse.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power-ups</h2>Pick up power-ups during your race to get an edge against your opponents, make sure to armor up as your foes will have the same weapons at hand.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tournaments</h2>Unlock the CARnage tournaments to win special vehicles for interesting driving experiences.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize</h2>Win Bolt-ons and Paintjobs from races to customize your rides to your enjoyment and needs.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Split-screen Multiplayer</h2>Race against your friends with up to 4 player split-screen locally or through Steam Remote Play Together.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923280/extras/1cbbec3252241639cd38736dec48b5bc.avif?t=1734094171\" width=616 height=80 /></span><br><br>CARnage comes with a wide variety of customization options, mainly you can grow your garage with a selection of vehicles spanning from cool to ridiculous<br><br>You can upgrade each cars engine, wheels, gearbox, suspension and armor as well as distribute bolt-ons that give you the extra edge needed to survive the apocalypse<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923280/extras/0028aae390bd6480f2880807bdda7145.poster.avif?t=1734094171\" width=616 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923280/extras/0028aae390bd6480f2880807bdda7145.webm?t=1734094171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>And make sure to paint your ride in your favorite color to feel amazing whilst crushing your opponents in the all-out warfare of tomorrow!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923280/extras/6e3b314b8ebc597a78c7595e99429cc2.avif?t=1734094171\" width=616 height=80 /></span><br><br>You wake up to the rumble of car engines, disoriented and without any memories on how you ended up in this car.<br><br>You do know that winning the race you apparently are in is your only hope to figure out where you are and how to get your memories back.<br><br>Survive the CARnage using weapons and the environment to your advantage!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923280/extras/30420822f9802d5d099068c9a412f1b2.poster.avif?t=1734094171\" width=616 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923280/extras/30420822f9802d5d099068c9a412f1b2.webm?t=1734094171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923280/extras/30420822f9802d5d099068c9a412f1b2.mp4?t=1734094171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>And make sure to stay away from the horrors that your opponents and tracks throw at you...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn